<title>CANADA: Stelco says Cedar Group appeal dismissed.</title>
<headline>Stelco says Cedar Group appeal dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Ontario 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stelco Inc said the Ontario Court of Appeal dismissed an appeal launched by Cedar Group Inc, wherein Cedar sought a 75 percent ownership interest in Stelco Fasteners Ltd, and C$10 million in damages.</p>
<p>Stelco Fasteners Ltd. continues to operate as a wholly owned subsidiary of Stelco Inc.</p>
<p>Cedar Group originally launched a suit against Stelco Inc after a deal to sell 75 percent of Stelco Fasteners to Cedar collapsed in 1994.</p>
<p>Cedar Group Inc has subsequently changed its name to Dominion Bridge Corp.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
